{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02895","headline":"和东观羣贤七夕临泛昆明池 · 任希古","name":"和东观羣贤七夕临泛昆明池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风始摇落，秋水正澄鲜。\n飞眺牵牛渚，激赏镂鲸川。\n岸珠沦晓魄，池灰敛曙烟。\n泛查分写汉，仪星别构天。\n云光波处动，日影浪中悬。\n惊鸿絓蒲弋，游鲤入庄筌。\n萍叶疑江上，菱花似镜前。\n长林代轻幄，细草即芳筵。\n文峰开翠潋，笔海控清涟。\n不挹兰樽圣，空仰桂舟仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任希古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}